# AL samples

- Put examples in colocated `samples/<topic>/File.al` next to the MDX tree
- Embed with include. Do not paste large AL fences in MDX:

```mdx
<include lang="al" meta='title="MultiStep.al"'>samples/tools/MultiStep.al</include>
```

- `meta` title must match the filename
- Keep samples **minimal** and realistic (SecretText for keys; no real credentials)
- One idea per file; prefer small focused snippets over full apps
- Hero snippets live under `content/al/hero/` and are wired from `lib/hero-examples.ts`
- If prose describes an API, a sample (or link to one) must demonstrate it
- Samples may only call public members of the pinned SDK (`docs/public-api.json`). Fragments may use the conventional variable names in `apiAliases` (`docs/docs-policy.json`) without declaring them
